+    "## The commands of LuckPerms in the runtime\n",
+    "\n",
+    "The plugin of the permissions owns `/luckperms` and its aliases. A command of the console writes\n",
+    "its change to the store and installs it at once, so the next check of the same tick sees it: Alex\n",
+    "holds `golem.player` once the console gave them the group `admin`, and the tool of the core plugin\n",
+    "answers them. A player who holds no node of the commands is refused. The store holds the change,\n",
+    "and the generation of the resolver is that of the store after the command. A change that another\n",
+    "writer puts into the store behind the resolver reaches it once a tick of the plugin wakes its\n",
+    "reload, and the store closes after the last step with every change in its file."
+   ]
